            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=4"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ አልቦ፡ ዘይትቃተል፡ ወይኄሊ፡ ንብረተ፡ ዝ፡ ዓለም። ዘእንበለ፡ ከመ፡ ያድሉ፡ ለዘሤሞ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 6,
          "unit_order": 6,
          "source_marker": "5",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=5"
          ],
          "text": "መስተጋድልኒ፡ ኢይከውኖ፡ ምዝጋና፡ ለእመ፡ በሕጉ፡ ኢተጋደለ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 7,
          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘኒ፡ ይጻሙ፡ ሐረሳዊ፡ ግብረ፡ ይቀድም፡ ለረኪበ፡ ፍሬሁ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": "7",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=7"
          ],
          "text": "ወለቡ፡ ዘእቤለከ፡ የሀብከ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ጥበበ፡ በኵሉ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
          "unit_order": 9,
          "source_marker": "8",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=8"
          ],
          "text": "ተዘከሮ፡ ለኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ዘተንሥአ፡ እምዉታን፡ ዘእምዘርዐ፡ ዳዊት፡ ዘመሀርኩ፡ በስሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 10,
          "unit_order": 10,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ሙቃሔ፡ ወትዕግሥት"
        },
        {
          "number": 11,
          "unit_order": 11,
          "source_marker": "9",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=9"
          ],
          "text": "ዘበእንቲኣሁ፡ እሠርሕ፡ ወእትሞቃሕ፡ ከመ፡ ጕሕልያ። ወባሕቱ፡ ቃለ፡ እግዚአብሔርሰ፡ ኢይትአሰር።"
        },
        {
          "number": 12,
          "unit_order": 12,
          "source_marker": "10",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=10"
          ],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ዝ፡ እትዔገሥ፡ በኵሉ፡ በእንተ፡ ኅሩያኒሁ። ከመ፡ እሙንቱሂ፡ ይርከቡ፡ ሕይወተ፡ ዘበኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ። ወስብሐተ፡ ዘለዓለም፡ ዘበሰማያት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 13,
          "unit_order": 13,
          "source_marker": "11",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=11"
          ],
          "text": "እሙን፡ ነገር፡ እምከመ፡ ዐረይነ፡ መዊተ፡ ንዔሪ፡ ሕይወተ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 14,
          "unit_order": 14,
          "source_marker": "12",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=12"
          ],
          "text": "ወእምከመ፡ ዐረይነ፡ ትዕግሥተ፡ ንዔሪ፡ ነጊሠ። ወእመሰ፡ ክሕድናሁ፡ ውእቱኒ፡ ይክሕደነ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 15,
          "unit_order": 15,
          "source_marker": "13",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=13"
          ],
          "text": "ወእመኒ፡ ኢአመናሁ፡ ውእቱሰ፡ ምእመነ፡ ይነብር፡ ወኢይክል፡ ክሒደ፡ ርእሶ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 16,
          "unit_order": 16,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ አስምዖ፡ ወአዕቅቦ"
        },
        {
          "number": 17,
          "unit_order": 17,
          "source_marker": "14",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=14"
          ],
          "text": "ከመ፡ ዝ፡ ዘክሮሙ፡ ወአስምዕ፡ ቅድመ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ኢትትላኰይ፡ በግብር። ዘኢይበቊዕ፡ በዘይትገፈትዑ፡ እለ፡ ይሰምዑ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 18,
          "unit_order": 18,
          "source_marker": "15",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "አስተፋጥን፡ ከመ፡ ትረሲ፡ ርእሰከ፡ ኅሩየ፡ ለኀበ፡ እግዚአብሔር። ከመ፡ ገባራዊ፡ ዘኢይትኀፈር፡ ዘርቱዐ፡ ይመትር፡ ቃለ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ በጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 19,
          "unit_order": 19,
          "source_marker": "16",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=16"
          ],
          "text": "ወለነገረ፡ ርኩሳንሰ፡ ዘአልቦ፡ ባቊዕ፡ እበዮ። እስመ፡ ያዐብይዋ፡ ለኀጢአቶሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 20,
          "unit_order": 20,
          "source_marker": "17",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=17"
          ],
          "text": "ወነገሮሙኒ፡ ከንቱ፡ ከመ፡ ዘይትረዐይ፡ ወይልህቅ፡ በብዙኃን፡ እለ፡ ሄሜኔዎስ፡ ወፊሎጦስ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 21,
          "unit_order": 21,
          "source_marker": "18",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=18"
          ],
          "text": "እለ፡ አውከኩ፡ እምጽድቅ፡ ወይብሉ፡ ወድአ፡ ኮነ፡ ትንሣኤ፡ ምዉታን። ወይገፈትዑ፡ ሃይማኖቶሙ፡ ለብዙኃን።"
        },
        {
          "number": 22,
          "unit_order": 22,
          "source_marker": "19",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=19"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘሰ፡ ጽኑዕ፡ በመሠረተ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ይቀውም፡ እንዘ፡ ቦ፡ ዘንተ፡ ማዕተበ። ወየአምሮሙ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ለእሊኣሁ፡ ወይርሕቅ፡ እምዐመፃ፡ ኵሉ፡ ዘይሰሚ፡ ስመ፡ እግዚአብሔር።"
        },
        {
          "number": 23,
          "unit_order": 23,
          "source_marker": "20",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=20"
          ],
          "text": "ውስተ፡ ቤትኒ፡ ዐቢይ፡ አኮ፡ ባሕቲቱ፡ ንዋየ፡ ወርቅ፡ ወብሩር። ዓዲ፡ ቦ፡ ዘዕፅኒ፡ ወዘልሕኵትኒ፡ ቦ፡ ዘለክብርኒ፡ ወቦ፡ ዘለኀሳርኒ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 24,
          "unit_order": 24,
          "source_marker": "21",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=21"
          ],
          "text": "ወእመ፡ ቦ፡ ዘአንጽሐ፡ ርእሶ፡ እምዝ፡ እኩይ፡ ይከውን፡ ንዋየ፡ ክብር፡ ቅዱሰ። ወባቊዐ፡ ለመልእክተ፡ እግዚኡ፡ ወድልወ፡ ለኵሉ፡ ምግባረ፡ ሠናይ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 25,
          "unit_order": 25,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ርኂቅ፡ እምኃጣውእ"
        },
        {
          "number": 26,
          "unit_order": 26,
          "source_marker": "22",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=22"
          ],
          "text": "ጕየያ፡ ለፍትወተ፡ ውርዙት፡ ወዴግና፡ ለጽድቅ፡ ወለሃይማኖት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 27,
          "unit_order": 27,
          "source_marker": "23",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=23"
          ],
          "text": "ተፋቅሮ፡ ወሰላም፡ ምስለ፡ ኵሎሙ፡ እለ፡ ይጼውዕዎ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ በልብ፡ ንጹሕ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 28,
          "unit_order": 28,
          "source_marker": "24",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=24"
          ],
          "text": "እበዮ፡ ለነገረ፡ እበድ፡ ወሥላቅ፡ ወተኃሥሦ፡ ከንቱ። ተኣምር፡ ከመ፡ መንሱተ፡ ያመጽእ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 29,
          "unit_order": 29,
          "source_marker": "25",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=25"
          ],
          "text": "ወገብረ፡ እግዚአብሔርሰ፡ ኢይትገአዝ፡ አላ፡ ከመ፡ ሕፃን፡ የዋሀ፡ ይከውን፡ ምስለ፡ ኵሉ። ወመምህረ፡ ወመስተዓግሠ፡ እምኵሉ፡ ወይጌሥጽ፡ በየውሀት፡ ለእለ፡ ይትቃረኑ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 30,
          "unit_order": 30,
          "source_marker": "26",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=26"
          ],
          "text": "እመ፡ ቦ፡ ከመ፡ የሀቦሙ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ይነስሑ፡ ወያእምርዋ፡ ለጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 31,
          "unit_order": 31,
          "source_marker": "27",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=2&verse=27"
          ],
          "text": "ወያንቅሑ፡ ነፍሶሙ፡ እመሥገርተ፡ ሰይጣን፡ እስመ፡ ወድአ፡ አሥገሮሙ፡ ለተሊወ፡ ፈቃዱ።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
