            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=5"
          ],
          "text": "ይትሜሰሉ፡ ጻድቃነ፡ ወይክሕድዎ፡ ለኀይለ፡ ጽድቅ። ወለእለ፡ ከመ፡ ዝ፡ ተገሐሦሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 7,
          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ እሙንቱ፡ እለ፡ ይትባውኡ፡ አብያተ፡ ሰብእ። ወይፄውውዎን፡ ለአንስት፡ እለ፡ ፅፉራት፡ በኀጢአት፡ ወያወርዳ፡ ውስተ፡ ብዙኀ፡ ፍትወት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": "7",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=7"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘልፈ፡ ይትጌሠጹ፡ ወኢየአምርዋ፡ ግሙራ፡ ለጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
          "unit_order": 9,
          "source_marker": "8",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=8"
          ],
          "text": "ከመ፡ ኢያኔስ፡ ወኢያንበሬስ፡ እለ፡ ተቃወምዎ፡ ለሙሴ። ከማሁ፡ እሉሂ፡ ተቃወምዋ፡ ለጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 10,
          "unit_order": 10,
          "source_marker": "9",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=9"
          ],
          "text": "ሰብእ፡ ሙሱናነ፡ ልብ፡ ወንፉቃነ፡ ሃይማኖት፡ ወኢይትሌዐሉ። እስመ፡ ፈድፈደት፡ እበዶሙ፡ ወተዐውቀት፡ ለኵሉ፡ ከመ፡ እበዶሙ፡ ለእልክቱ፡ ዓዲ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 11,
          "unit_order": 11,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ተሊዎተ፡ መምህራን"
        },
        {
          "number": 12,
          "unit_order": 12,
          "source_marker": "10",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=10"
          ],
          "text": "ወአንተሰ፡ ተለውከ፡ ትምህርትየ፡ ወተመሰል፡ በግዕዝየ። በዘመሀርኩከ፡ በሃይማኖት፡ ወበተፋቅሮ፡ ወበትዕግሥት፡ ወበኅድአት፡ ወበተሰዶ፡ ወበሕማም።"
        },
        {
          "number": 13,
          "unit_order": 13,
          "source_marker": "11",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=11"
          ],
          "text": "ተኣምር፡ መጠነ፡ ረከበኒ፡ በአንጾኪያ፡ ወበኢቆንያ፡ ወበልስጥራን። መጠነ፡ ተዐገሥኩ፡ ተሰዶ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 14,
          "unit_order": 14,
          "source_marker": "12",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=12"
          ],
          "text": "ወእምኵሉ፡ አድኀነኒ፡ እግዚአብሔር። ወኵሎሙ፡ እለ፡ ይፈቅዱ፡ ይሕየዉ፡ በጽድቀ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ የሐምሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 15,
          "unit_order": 15,
          "source_marker": "13",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=13"
          ],
          "text": "ወሰብእሰ፡ እኩያን፡ ይትሌዐሉ፡ ውስተ፡ እንተ፡ ተአኪ፡ ወይስሕቱ፡ ወያስሕቱ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 16,
          "unit_order": 16,
          "source_marker": "14",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=14"
          ],
          "text": "ወአንተሰ፡ ሀሉ፡ በዘተምህርከ፡ ወተአመንከ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 17,
          "unit_order": 17,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ቅዱስ"
        },
        {
          "number": 18,
          "unit_order": 18,
          "source_marker": "15",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "ተኣምር፡ በኀበ፡ መኑ፡ ተምህርከ። እምን፡ እስከ፡ መጽሐፈ፡ ቅዱሰ። ዘይክል፡ አሕይዎተከ፡ በሃይማኖተ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 19,
          "unit_order": 19,
          "source_marker": "16",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=16"
          ],
          "text": "ወኵሉ፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ዘበመንፈሰ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ተጽሕፈ። ይበቊዕ፡ ለኵሉ፡ ትምህርት፡ ወተግሣጽ፡ ወአርትዖ፡ ወጥበብ፡ ወጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 20,
          "unit_order": 20,
          "source_marker": "17",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=3&verse=17"
          ],
          "text": "ከመ፡ ይትገሠጽ፡ ብእሴ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ውስተ፡ ኵሉ፡ ምግባረ፡ ሠናይ።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
