          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=4&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ወአንሰ፡ ወዳእኩ፡ ወሠለጥኩ፡ ወበጽሐኒ፡ ዕድሜየ፡ ለአዕርፎ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
          "unit_order": 9,
          "source_marker": "7",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=4&verse=7"
          ],
          "text": "ሠናየ፡ ገድለ፡ ተጋደልኩ፡ በድርየኒ፡ ፈጸምኩ፡ ወሃይማኖትየኒ፡ ዐቀብኩ።"
