          "source_marker": "11",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=4&verse=11"
          ],
          "text": "ወአምጽኦ፡ ምስሌከ፡ ለማርቆስ፡ እስመ፡ ይበቊዐኒ፡ ለመልእክት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 14,
          "unit_order": 14,
          "source_marker": "12",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=2Ti&chapter=4&verse=12"
          ],
          "text": "ወፈነውክዎ፡ ለጢኪቆስ፡ ኤፌሶን።"
        },
        {
